**1 [[One Horn]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**3 [[Easter B.B.Bunny|Easter Bunnies]] spawn, delay 36.67~40 seconds<sup>1,100~1,200f</sup>.
**1 [[Easter Duche]] spawns.

