==Strategy==
Levels 1-4 are quite easy. Use Red crowd-controllers and meatshield properly as Easter Duche can push. Also bring some fast or high damage Cats like [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Lion Cat]] or [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Hip Hop Cat]].

